OL,3,GNEWSARock stars sign guitar to fund    
OL,4,Anature scheme                          
OL,6,FA guitar signed by Sir Paul McCartney, 
OL,7,FSam Fender and Sting is set to be      
OL,8,Fauctioned off to raise money for a     
OL,9,Fnature restoration project.            
OL,11,FThe instrument, which has also has the 
OL,12,Fautographs of Dire Straits star Mark   
OL,13,FKnopfler and Grammy Award nominee Joan 
OL,14,FArmatrading, is being sold to help fund
OL,15,Fwork at the Rothbury Estate in         
OL,16,FNorthumberland.                        
OL,18,FThe Wildlife Trusts and Northumberland 
OL,19,FWildlife Trust purchased the land after
OL,20,Fraising #30m to buy it from the son of 
OL,21,Fthe Duke of Northumberland, Lord Max   
OL,22,FPercy.                                 
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
