OL,3,GNEWSARock stars sign guitar to fund    
OL,4,Anature scheme                          
OL,6,FThe Wildlife Trusts' head of major     
OL,7,Fgifts, Debbie Johnson, said the        
OL,8,Fnorth-east of England had a "rich      
OL,9,Fmusical heritage" and described the    
OL,10,Fguitar as "very special".              
